# EXPECT-ERROR: bound to scope
module wrong_proof_scope
lineage L_A
agent A lineage L_A
grant A effect externalAct
observe e by A content "event" confidence 0.95
endorse e by A threshold 0.9
authorize e by A for toolCall
authorize e by A for planning
proof pa access e by A
proof po origin e source A lineage L_A
proof pc clear e for A
proof pe endorsement e by A
proof pu authorization e by A for toolCall
proof p_use use e by A for toolCall from ["pa","po","pc","pe","pu"]
plan act by A using e effect externalAct requires p_use
